# Force LF line endings for files that get COPYed into the Linux image and
# executed there. A CRLF shebang line (`#!/usr/bin/env bash\r`) fails to
# run in the container, so this must hold regardless of a contributor's
# local core.autocrlf setting.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
*.template text eol=lf
railway.json text eol=lf
